/-!
# W06a: local-MGF cumulants and all Hilbert coefficient splits

Main theorem `cumulantTensor_splitNorm_le_rpow` concerns the actual log-MGF
cumulant tensor and every nonempty proper slot partition. It proves the
factorial bound from local MGF finiteness and polynomial-test Poincaré.
The local analytic supplier, finite coefficient identity, factorial majorant,
centering invariance, zero-Poincaré endpoint, and normalized-posterior
specialization are all proved. No jets of a conditional flow or time-zero
flow extension are included.

Finite generic jet calculus and Appell identities are adapted from
openai/math revision 1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a, Apache-2.0:
JetEstimates/Growth.lean, CrossMoment.lean, Bound.lean,
NormalizedLaplace.lean, AssignmentsFinset.lean and MixedJetAdd.lean.
The global exponential-moment supplier is replaced by a proved local one;
the upstream coarse combinatorial loss is replaced by the exact factorial
assignment count and Vandermonde sum.
-/

